---
const sections = [
  {
    number: "01",
    title: "Why hearts and wearables care",
    description: "The everyday story behind ECG signals and event-driven computing.",
    href: "/projects/snnjotter/everyday-story",
  },
  {
    number: "02",
    title: "The real engineering puzzle",
    description: "Fitting a useful model onto a small FPGA without losing the important details.",
    href: "/projects/snnjotter/engineering-puzzle",
  },
  {
    number: "03",
    title: "How the pipeline works",
    description: "Follow the path from heartbeat recordings to a configurable chip.",
    href: "/projects/snnjotter/pipeline",
  },
  {
    number: "04",
    title: "What those words actually mean",
    description: "A pocket glossary for the signals, neurons, and hardware in this project.",
    href: "/projects/snnjotter/glossary",
  },
  {
    number: "05",
    title: "A flexible road to May",
    description: "The broad milestones guiding the capstone as it develops.",
    href: "/projects/snnjotter/roadmap",
  },
];
---

<article class="mx-auto max-w-3xl py-10 sm:py-14">
  <header class="rounded-[1.75rem] border border-primary/25 bg-surface px-6 py-9 text-center sm:px-10 sm:py-12">
    <h1 class="font-serif text-4xl font-bold leading-tight text-white sm:text-5xl">SNNJotter</h1>
    <p class="mx-auto mt-4 max-w-2xl text-base leading-relaxed text-white/80 sm:text-lg">
      A friendly notebook for my capstone: <span class="font-semibold text-white">FPGA-Accelerated Spiking Neural Networks for Real-Time Biomedical Signal Inference.</span>
    </p>
  </header>

  <section class="mt-8" aria-labelledby="contents-title">
    <div class="mb-4 px-1">
      <p class="text-xs font-semibold uppercase tracking-[0.18em] text-primary">SNNJotter notebook</p>
      <h2 id="contents-title" class="mt-2 font-serif text-2xl font-bold text-white sm:text-3xl">Table of contents</h2>
      <p class="mt-2 text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/70">Choose a section to open its own page.</p>
    </div>
    <ol class="space-y-3">
      {sections.map((section) => (
        <li>
          <a
            href={section.href}
            class="group flex items-start gap-4 rounded-2xl border border-white/10 bg-white/[0.035] p-5 transition-colors hover:border-primary/45 hover:bg-primary/[0.07] focus-visible:outline-2 focus-visible:outline-offset-2 focus-visible:outline-primary sm:items-center sm:p-6"
          >
            <span class="grid h-11 w-11 shrink-0 place-items-center rounded-full border border-primary/35 bg-primary/10 text-sm font-bold text-primary" aria-hidden="true">{section.number}</span>
            <span class="min-w-0 flex-1">
              <span class="block font-serif text-lg font-bold text-white group-hover:text-primary sm:text-xl">{section.title}</span>
              <span class="mt-1 block text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/70">{section.description}</span>
            </span>
            <span class="mt-2 shrink-0 text-lg text-primary transition-transform group-hover:translate-x-1 sm:mt-0" aria-hidden="true">→</span>
            <span class="sr-only">Open {section.title}</span>
          </a>
        </li>
      ))}
    </ol>
  </section>

  <p class="mt-8 border-t border-white/10 pt-5 text-sm leading-relaxed text-white/60">
    These are learning notes about a capstone workflow—not medical advice, a clinical tool, or a report of experimental results.
  </p>
</article>
